; The exception list and the function words. Cards pass through except words: a word's letters (1-27) go onto this
; machine's own pile (OUT at keep, back to INP at gw), counting n. At its end (-10) the word is looked for in the
; exceptions deck, read through to its end (-99; the host deals it again for each word, INP at gd): first the
; function words (letters, -52), then the exceptions (letters, -50, phonemes, -51). Each entry is compared letter by
; letter with the word as the word goes round the pile once. An exception's phonemes go out (stress 0 in a function
; word), then -20; any other word's letters go on, then -14 for a function word, else -13.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   x        03-15: a card: pass it on, a letter onto the pile, or a word's end
  04                    CLA   x
  05                    TAC   neg
  06                    SUB   c28
  07                    TAC   let
  08            pass    OUT   x
  09                    JMP   rec
  10            neg     ADD   c10
  11                    TAC   pass
  12                    SUB   00
  13                    TAC   look
  14                    JMP   pass
  15            let     ADD   c28
  16            keep    OUT   x
  17                    CLA   n
  18                    ADD   00
  19                    STO   n
  20                    JMP   rec
  21            look    CLA   z        21-46: an entry, compared with the word
  22                    STO   fn
  23                    STO   ex
  24            ent     CLA   z
  25                    STO   i
  26                    CLA   00
  27                    STO   m
  28            gd      INP   e
  29                    CLA   e
  30                    TAC   mk
  31                    CLA   i
  32                    SUB   n
  33                    TAC   cmp
  34                    JMP   mis
  35            cmp     CLA   i
  36                    ADD   00
  37                    STO   i
  38            gw      INP   w
  39            kw      OUT   w
  40                    CLA   w
  41                    SUB   e
  42                    TAC   mis
  43                    CLA   e
  44                    SUB   w
  45                    TAC   mis
  46                    JMP   gd
  47            mis     CLA   z
  48                    STO   m
  49                    JMP   gd
  50            mk      CLA   i        50-60: the entry's end: the rest of the word round the pile
  51                    SUB   n
  52                    TAC   cy
  53                    JMP   kind
  54            cy      CLA   z
  55                    STO   m
  56                    JMP   cmp
  57            kind    CLA   e        57-77: a function word, an exception, or the deck's end
  58                    ADD   c52
  59                    TAC   end
  60                    SUB   00
  61                    TAC   fnw
  62                    CLA   m
  63                    SUB   00
  64                    TAC   skip
  65                    CLA   00
  66                    STO   ex
  67            ph      INP   e
  68                    CLA   e
  69                    TAC   ent
  70                    CLA   fn
  71                    SUB   00
  72                    TAC   po
  73                    CLA   e
  74                    SFT   01
  75                    SFT   10
  76                    STO   e
  77            po      OUT   e
  78                    JMP   ph
  79            skip    INP   e
  80                    CLA   e
  81                    TAC   ent
  82                    JMP   skip
  83            fnw     CLA   m
  84                    STO   fn
  85                    JMP   ent
  86            end     CLA   n        86-: the word, or nothing, from the pile; the end card
